>>
endobj
5730 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1725 0 R
/E (When you assign a role, you activate a specific subset of the AI's knowledge. 'Act as a B2B sales coach' pulls very different reasoning than 'Act as a financial analyst'  for the same question. The Expert Chair goes further: assign a role, define their expertise level, and describe what outcome they care most about. The more specific the role, the less generic the answer, since a vague expert gives a vague opinion but a precisely defined one brings actual priorities to the table.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
5731 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 12111 0 R
/E (Define the role as specifically as possible  seniority and specialisation matter.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
