<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1727 0 R
/E (Most people run the critique step, get three weaknesses, fix them  then stop. They skip Step 4 \(Lock\). That final check is where the last 10% of quality lives, and it's also where the error you didn't notice gets caught. Two loops takes four minutes. One loop leaves quality on the table.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [18]
>>
