/P 1748 0 R
/E (Created by Alexander Osterwalder, the Business Model Canvas maps a business across nine building blocks: Customer Segments, Value Propositions, Channels, Customer Relationships, Revenue Streams, Key Resources, Key Activities, Key Partnerships, and Cost Structure. When completed, it shows you whether your model is internally coherent  and where the weakest links are. It's the fastest way to see your whole business in one view.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
