<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1750 0 R
/E (Ash Maurya adapted the Business Model Canvas into the Lean Canvas specifically for startups. It replaces the left-side partnership and activity blocks with Problem, Solution, Key Metrics, and Unfair Advantage, the four things that matter most before product-market fit. The Lean Canvas is designed to be completed in one sitting and updated as you learn. Think of it as a living hypothesis, not a fixed plan.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
