6579 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1752 0 R
/E (TThe ERRC grid forces a trade-off most businesses avoid: you cannot raise everything. Every Raise requires an Eliminate to fund it. That discipline is what separates a genuine Blue Ocean move from a feature list. Most founders fill in Create and Raise easily but stall on Eliminate, because giving something up feels like admitting weakness rather than making a strategic choice. The businesses that actually reshape their category are the ones willing to look incomplete by old industry standards on purpose.)
/Pg 64 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
