7099 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1769 0 R
/E (Developed by Francis Aguilar at Harvard in 1967, PESTLE is a macro-environment scan across six dimensions: Political \(government policy and stability\), Economic \(growth, inflation, interest rates\), Social \(demographics, culture, behaviour trends\), Technological \(innovation, disruption, digital adoption\), Legal \(regulations, compliance\), Environmental \(sustainability, climate, physical\). AI has broad knowledge across all six dimensions and can generate a detailed PESTLE in minutes when given the right context.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
