<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1769 0 R
/E (Before Monzo launched in the UK, its team ran a PESTLE analysis and identified two critical factors: FCA regulatory changes opening challenger bank licensing, and a generational shift in how under-35s trusted traditional banks. Neither was in the existing competitor analysis. Those two factors not the product features  became the foundation of Monzo's go-to-market timing and positioning.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [15]
>>
