7230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1773 0 R
/E (The Ideal Customer Profile defines the specific type of company or individual who will get the most value from your product, buy fastest, pay most, and stay longest. It is not a target audience,  it is a precise description of your best-fit customer based on firmographic, behavioural, and situational criteria. Building sales and marketing around your ICP dramatically improves conversion, reduces churn, and focuses your team on the accounts most likely to grow.)
/Pg 85 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
