/E (Competitor mapping is the structured process of plotting your competitors across dimensions that matter to your customers  price, capability, speed, service model, target segment, and key differentiators. Done well, it reveals clusters of competition \(where everyone is fighting\), white spaces \(where no one plays\), and your own positioning clarity. AI can build a preliminary map quickly when given enough context about your market.)
/Pg 89 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
