/S /P
/P 1779 0 R
/E (Oatly's positioning statement wasn't built around 'plant-based milk alternative.' It was built around a specific enemy: the dairy industry lobby. Their statement polarised the market intentionally , people who agreed with their position became advocates, not just customers. Positioning works best when it defines who you are NOT for as clearly as who you are for.)
/Pg 91 0 R
/K [13]
>>
