/E (HOW TO USE IT)
/Pg 93 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
7512 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1781 0 R
/E (The Empathy Grid, popularised by IDEO and widely used in design thinking, maps what your customer Thinks and Feels, Sees, Hears, Says and Does, and their Pains and Gains. Combined with Voice of Customer \(VOC\) research - the actual words customers use to describe their problems - it builds a rich picture of the customer's inner world. AI can simulate this map quickly when given enough context, and help you extract VOC language from customer interviews or reviews. A grid built from assumptions just formalizes your own guesses. VOC matters because customers rarely describe problems the way you'd describe your solution.)
/Pg 93 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
7513 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 12659 0 R
/E (Feed AI your customer's industry, role, and the problem they face. 2. Also paste in any real customer reviews, interview notes, or support tickets you have.)
/Pg 93 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
