7863 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1792 0 R
/E (BANT \(Budget, Authority, Need, Timeline\) was developed by IBM as a qualification framework. A prospect must have all four to be a real opportunity. CHAMP \(Challenges, Authority, Money, Prioritisation\) is a modern evolution that starts with the customer's challenge rather than your budget question  making it less transactional and more consultative. AI can help you build qualification questions that feel like discovery, not interrogation.)
/Pg 104 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
