>>
endobj
7939 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1794 0 R
/E (Based on a five-year study of 6,000 sales professionals by Matthew Dixon and Brent Adamson, The Challenger Sale found that the highest-performing reps don't just build relationships, they challenge the customer's thinking. The Challenger approach has three moves: Teach \(share a provocative insight the prospect hasn't considered\), Tailor \(connect the insight to the specific business or individual\), Take Control \(guide the conversation toward your unique solution confidently\). The insight you teach must be counterintuitive and directly connected to a problem only you solve.)
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
