8006 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1796 0 R
/E ('We need to think about it' is never about thinking. It is always about one of three things: they don't see enough value, they don't have authority, or they don't have urgency. The Explore question reveals which one it is. Without that question, you're responding to the wrong problem.)
/Pg 108 0 R
/K [16]
>>
