8053 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1798 0 R
/E (PAS is a direct response copywriting framework popularised by Dan Kennedy and widely used across sales pages, cold emails, LinkedIn posts, and pitch decks. Problem: name the specific pain the prospect feels. Agitate: expand the consequences - what happens if this problem goes unsolved? What does it cost them in time, money, reputation, or opportunity? Solve: present your solution as the logical answer to the agitated problem. The Agitate step is where most founders stop short, they name the problem but never make the reader feel its weight.)
/Pg 110 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
