8270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1804 0 R
/E (A Deal Health Check is a structured review of each active opportunity against a set of objective criteria: Is there a confirmed problem?  Have you spoken to the real decision-maker? Is there a defined budget? Is there a timeline with consequences for missing it? Have objections been surfaced and addressed? Is there a mutual next step with a date? Deals that can't answer all six questions are at risk  regardless of what the CRM stage says. AI can conduct a deal health review when you describe the deal's current state.)
/Pg 116 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
