8408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1808 0 R
/E (You describe your product by listing features and specifications. Prospects nod politely and then say they'll think about it. The features are real and impressive  but they're not translating into desire.)
/Pg 120 0 R
