/P 1808 0 R
/E (HOW TO USE IT)
/Pg 120 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
8410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1808 0 R
/E (FAB is a foundational sales communication framework dating to the 1960s. Features describe what a product has or does. Advantages explain why that feature is better than the alternative. Benefits describe what the feature and advantage mean for this specific customer in their specific situation. Most salespeople stop at Feature or Advantage. The customer only cares about the Benefit and even then, only the benefit that is relevant to their specific pain. AI can translate any feature into a customer-specific benefit when given the right context.)
/Pg 120 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
