14253 0 obj
<<
/Title (THE FRAMEWORK)
/Dest [112 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 12952 0 R
>>
endobj
14254 0 obj
<<
/Title (A Win Story is a proposal structure that mirrors how humans make decisions -  through narrative, not specifications. The structure has six parts: Situation \(their world as it is today\), Complication \(the problem and its cost\), Resolution \(what success looks like\), Solution \(your approach- positioned as the bridge from complication to resolution\), Proof \(evidence that you can deliver\), and Call to Action \(one clear, specific next step\). The key difference from a standard proposal is that the customer's story comes first. Your solution is a supporting character, not the lead.)
/Dest [112 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 126 0 R
/Prev 12952 0 R
/First 15187 0 R
/Last 15188 0 R
/Count -2
/Next 15189 0 R
>>
endobj
